            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html ng-app=myApp ng-controller=TranslateCtrl><head><script src=\"/js/gettext.min.js?094907\"></script><meta / charset=UTF-8><link href=\"/style.min.css?094907\" rel=stylesheet type=text/css><script src=\"/js/webchange.js?094907\"></script></head><body class=ng-cloak><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=750><tr><td><b parent=\"{{ 'Applications' | translate }}\" sub-title translate>SMS / Mail Alert Service</b><hr><form action=/cgi-bin/sms.cgi method=post name=frm1><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=0 width=100%><tr><td class=ontab id=tab1 onClick=gotoPage(0) width=20%><b translate>SMS Alert</b></td><td class=offtab id=tab2 onClick=gotoPage(1) width=20%><b translate>Mail Alert</b></td><td class=tabpadding>&nbsp;</td><td align=right class=red>|&nbsp; <a class=DenyLink href=# onClick=javascript:settodefault() translate>Set to Factory Default</a>&nbsp;|</td></tr></table><table border=1 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=0 width=100%><tr><td><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 class=table-striped width=100%><thead><tr align=center><th translate width=7%>Index</th><th translate width=7%>Enable</th><th width=15%> <a href=\"/cgi-bin/sms.cgi?sFormAuthStr=JdvKVyYlhh7GhS9&sProfileAct=showpage\" translate>SMS Provider</a></th><th translate width=20%>Recipient Number</th><th width=12%> <a href=\"/cgi-bin/sms.cgi?sFormAuthStr=JdvKVyYlhh7GhS9&sProfileAct=notishowpage\" translate>Notify Profile</a></th><th> <a href=\"/cgi-bin/v2x00.cgi?sFormAuthStr=JdvKVyYlhh7GhS9&fid=2056\" translate>Schedule(1-15)</a></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr align=center ng-init=i=$index ng-repeat=\"prof in profileInfo track by $index\"><th>{{i+1}}</th><td><input name=enable{{i}} ng-model=prof.enable type=checkbox value=1></td><td><select convert-to-number name=sms_prof{{i}} ng-disabled=!prof.enable ng-model=prof.provider><option ng-init=j=$index ng-repeat=\"sms in arySmsProf track by $index\" value={{j}}>{{(j+1)+\" - \"+sms}}</option><option id=LTE5G ng-if=\"bLTESMS && SHOW_LTE\" value=255>{{sLTEmodulename}} <translate>Modem</translate></option></select></td><td><input name=rep{{i}} ng-disabled=!prof.enable ng-model=prof.receiver></td><td><select convert-to-number name=noti_prof{{i}} ng-disabled=!prof.enable ng-model=prof.notify><option ng-init=j=$index ng-repeat=\"noti in aryNotiProf track by $index\" value={{j}}>{{(j+1)+\" - \"+noti}}</option></select></td><td><select convert-to-number name=sche{{i}}_0 ng-change=chgSch(i+'_0') ng-disabled=!prof.enable ng-model=prof.schedule1 size=1 style=width:100px><option translate value=0>None</option><option translate value=100>Schedule List</option><option translate value=101>[Create New]</option><option ng-if=sch.length ng-init=j=$index+1 ng-repeat=\"sch in arySchCmmt track by $index\" value={{j}}>{{j+\"-\"+sch}}</option></select><select convert-to-number name=sche{{i}}_1 ng-change=chgSch(i+'_1') ng-disabled=!prof.enable ng-model=prof.schedule2 size=1 style=width:100px><option translate value=0>None</option><option translate value=100>Schedule List</option><option translate value=101>[Create New]</option><option ng-if=sch.length ng-init=j=$index+1 ng-repeat=\"sch in arySchCmmt track by $index\" value={{j}}>{{j+\"-\"+sch}}</option></select></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></table><div><b translate>Note</b>: <ol><li translate>All the SMS Alert profiles share the same \"Sending Interval\" setting if they use the same SMS Provider.</li><li id=link_note ng-if=\"bLTESMS && SHOW_LTE\" translate>If SMS Provider is \"LTE Modem\", the \"Quota\" is controlled by LTE &gt;&gt; <a>SMS Quota Limit</a> and the \"Sending Interval\" is 3 seconds.</li></ol></div><br><table align=center width=100%><tr align=center><td><input class=btnw name=btnOk onclick=onClkBtnOk() type=button value=\"{{ 'OK' | translate }}\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <input class=btnw name=btnCcl onclick=onClkBtnCcl() type=button value=\"{{ 'Cancel' | translate }}\"></td></tr></table><input name