            "size": 5044,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "compression": 2487,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html ng-app=myApp ng-controller=TranslateCtrl><head><script src=\"/js/gettext.min.js?094907\"></script><meta / charset=UTF-8><link href=\"/style.min.css?094907\" rel=stylesheet type=text/css><script src=\"/js/dhtml.min.js?094907\"></script><script> function reorder_subject(cert_str){var i,str1=\"\";var str=cert_str.split(\"/\");if(str.length==1){document.write(cert_str);}else{for(i=1;i<str.length;i++){if(i!=str.length-1)str1=str1+str[i]+\", \";else str1=str1+str[i];}document.write(str1);}}</script><script src=\"/js/webchange.js?094907\"></script></head><body class=ng-cloak><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=700><tr><td><b parent=\"{{ 0 ? ('Certificate Management' | translate) : ('System Maintenance' | translate) }}\" sub-title translate>Self-Signed Certificate</b><hr><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 width=100%><tr><td align=left><b translate>Self-Signed Certificate Information</b></td></tr></table><table align=center border=1 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=0 width=100%><tr><td><table align=center border=0 cellpadding=2 cellspacing=2 width=100%><tr class=row0><td><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>Certificate Name</translate> :</nobr></td><td width=100%>&nbsp;self-signed</td></tr><tr class=row1><td><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>Issuer</translate> :</nobr></td><td>&nbsp;<script>reorder_subject(\"C = TW, ST = HsinChu, L = HuKou, O = DrayTek Corp., OU = DrayTek Support, CN = Vigor Router\");</script></td></tr><tr class=row0><td><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>Subject</translate> :</nobr></td><td>&nbsp;<script>reorder_subject(\"C = TW, ST = HsinChu, L = HuKou, O = DrayTek Corp., OU = DrayTek Support, CN = Vigor Router\");</script></td></tr><tr class=row1><td><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>Subject Alternative Name</translate> :</nobr></td><td>&nbsp;DNS:www.draytek.com</td></tr><tr class=row0><td><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>Valid From</translate> :</nobr></td><td>&nbsp;Oct 22 09:51:28 2024 GMT+00:00</td></tr><tr class=row1><td><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>Valid To</translate> :</nobr></td><td>&nbsp;Nov 23 09:51:28 2025 GMT+00:00<span ng-if=\"Unsecure\" style=\"margin-left:20px\"><b style=color:#e7b309 translate>Note</b>:<ol><li translate>Valid period longer than {{iValidPeriod}} days is unsecure.</li></ol></span></td></tr><tr class=row0><td valign=top><nobr>&nbsp;<translate>PEM Format Content</translate> :</nobr></td><td>&nbsp;<textarea cols=65 rows=22>-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\nMIIDpjCCAo6gAwIBAgIJALyXPj3CTDE8MA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBCwUAMHgxCzAJBgNV\nBAYTAlRXMRAwDgYDVQQIDAdIc2luQ2h1MQ4wDAYDVQQHDAVIdUtvdTEWMBQGA1UE\nCgwNRHJheVRlayBDb3JwLjEYMBYGA1UECwwPRHJheVRlayBTdXBwb3J0MRUwEwYD\nVQQDDAxWaWdvciBSb3V0ZXIwHhcNMjQxMDIyMDk1MTI4WhcNMjUxMTIzMDk1MTI4\nWjB4MQswCQYDVQQGEwJUVzEQMA4GA1UECAwHSHNpbkNodTEOMAwGA1UEBwwFSHVL\nb3UxFjAUBgNVBAoMDURyYXlUZWsgQ29ycC4xGDAWBgNVBAsMD0RyYXlUZWsgU3Vw\ncG9ydDEVMBMGA1UEAwwMVmlnb3IgUm91dGVyMIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOC\nAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEAz5okTdTSZdkOgVfKAUJbYG2Nv+Ax9LB0yrgwDzCVz/k8op4s\nGZE+XrXv9/tb+jMuG3+gnXLKxwW3s23PzirwYIqD7N/LGoOGHeckW8IIY2MbGKV6\ndM+hJV7PD6q1GsNszv3AIDs9gZDKCfTXgYpYzHjIHuk3G7uNTWPz9OPdZSlWd7IG\nopuuC3Mpylu27mlxpMV6oIA7p7oPFppX75/VXFeQ9yqR0L6ERnDA7vI0+Xp3+H3H\nnM1mHO0nTMjtlOiZ6aTjR9fmUAhJpefTdfoBHaQhMnI/CXXGjZsH5bt/jEtV9LNA\nPSgUW8i8E+ZE0ySWs3jnIpaDWJD0WGgHA0jdQwIDAQABozMwMTATBgNVHSUEDDAK\nBggrBgEFBQcDATAaBgNVHREEEzARgg93d3cuZHJheXRlay5jb20wDQYJKoZIhvcN\nAQELBQADggEBALWjRUs65o0FfgHsA/dyeo6KycqT0nfZq2BnXxe9Xqw30CsNjqLY\n3qOP9pjSXLkICxtaGOBQ0WnQi3KFhidHTr2xlcblteXaOfQ7MGtoNdND0upcYgu9\nKRZkZapQ8qWVD9Qgysa9fhOQArUj64W6V/7Lhuj/LCpOECGXQAQgaFf/+cfLbs0v\ntwZLsjh9AUuXsa80VUPNx2LEoEXR6fDGsrgSwGwf04AYHOVnQHyu/EMX0uy6TrLq\ndOgJeEPxE2jHJ07qB1XkliorO28xxWgrxaoZPdp3Zwg1bn974sz3E5yZtaBjN5Jt\nKMLIMPVegcpawPOrVcOgpjuFnB7xpP73Md8=\n-----END CERTIFICATE-----\n</textarea></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><table><b translate>Note</b>: <ol><li id=note translate>Please setup the <a>System Maintenance &gt;&gt; Time and Date</a> correctly before you try to regenerate a self-signed certificate!!</li><li translate>The Time Zone MUST be setup correctly!!</li></ol><tbody data-new-cert=true><tr><td colspan=2><translate>Self-Signed Certificate is a default certificate. You can create or import a certificate to</translate>&nbsp; <a href=/doc/xlocf1.HTM><translate>Certificate Management</translate>&nbsp;>>&nbsp;<translate>Local Certificate</translate></a><translate>as router certificate.</translate></td></tr></tbody></table><br><table align=center><tr data-new-cert><td><input onClick=\"javascript:document.location.href = 'XSelfG.HTM';\" type=button value=\"{{ 'Regenerate' | translate }}\"></td></tr></table><br></td></tr></table><script src=\"/js/variable.js?36031\"></script><script>top.ACTION_STATUS=-1;top.iActionStatusFlag='0';top.iFwUpgradeState='0';top.act_sta.damage_alert();angular.element(document).ready(function(){$scope.iValidPeriod=\"397\";if('Not Valid Yet'=='Unsecure'){$scope.Unsecure=true;}else{$scope.Unsecure=false;}$scope.$apply();angular.element(document.querySelector(\"#note a\")).attr(\"href\",'/cgi-bin/V2X00.cgi?sFormAuthStr=JdvKVyYlhh7GhS9&fid=6');});</script></body></html>"
